WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening, I'm Seth Myers.
This is "Late Night".

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:03.936
We hope you're doing well, and
now, if you don't mind,

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.471
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:07.974
President Biden spoke last night
about the upcoming

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:11.077
midterm elections and said,
quote, "In our bones,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.112
we know democracy is at risk."

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:17.516
And you know the president is
old when he gets his best intel

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:19.619
from his bones.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:23.456
Ah, knee's acting up,
I feel a veto coming on.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.126
President Biden urged voters
in his speech last night

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:29.528
to stand up for democracy and
said that Americans don't settle

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:32.197
political differences, quote,
"With a riot or a mob

00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:33.333
or a bullet or a hammer."

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.601
We don't?

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:39.238
Because if not,
that's a weirdly specific list.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:41.174
That's like if your wife asked
if you were cheating

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.242
and you said, "I don't even
think Rebecca's that sexy,

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.810
and I certainly wouldn't meet up
with her

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.813
at the Hotel Radisson Airport."

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.285
I put all the word
in a different order.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.755
I wanted to see if it worked,
if you put them all

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.190
in a different word.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.325
That's how you say it, right?

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:01.061
The Hotel Radisson Airport.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:08.734
Alex -- he's our director --
can you just cut it up

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:12.005
and move all the words around
in post?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.277
Problem solved. [ Laughs ]

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.980
In a new interview, Georgia
Senate candidate Herschel Walker

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.415
said that he has a better résumé

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.150
than Former President
Barack Obama.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:29.188
Really? It's better than
Former President Barack Obama?

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:34.127
The only thing your résumé has
that his doesn't is typos.

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:36.829
CNN released a new poll
yesterday that suggests

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.365
Democrats may be facing
an enthusiasm problem

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.100
ahead of next week's
midterm elections,

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.336
which explains this here
sticker.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:48.341
Former President Trump is
reportedly considering

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.743
the two-week stretch after
the midterm elections

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.078
as a window to formally announce
he's running for president

00:01:53.078 --> 00:01:54.113
in 2024.

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.883
Oh, right before Thanksgiving?
Awesome.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.952
Are you also gonna announce
that Aunt Lisa and her friend

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:01.421
aren't just roommates?

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:09.395
Elon Musk tweeted yesterday,
quote...

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:13.900
For instance, it could mean
you're the president.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.969
SpaceX this week launched
its Falcon Heavy,

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.905
which is the most powerful
rocket in the world,

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.941
but I don't know how safe it is,
considering SpaceX is, I guess,

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:25.210
Elon Musk's third priority.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:29.615
Who starts a space program
in their spare time?

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.918
NASCAR driver Ross Chastain
qualified

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.719
for a championship race
over the weekend

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:36.221
after performing
a wall-riding maneuver

00:02:36.221 --> 00:02:38.857
that he claimed to have learned
from a Nintendo GameCube

00:02:38.857 --> 00:02:40.559
video game as a child.

00:02:40.559 --> 00:02:43.128
Even crazier, Denny Hamlin moved
into fifth place

00:02:43.128 --> 00:02:47.634
after throwing a red shell
at the driver in front of him.

00:02:50.135 --> 00:02:53.105
Two chefs in Boston recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:56.909
by assembling a sushi roll
that was over seven feet wide.

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.678
Now for the sad news.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:04.684
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.418
We realized the real problem
with that joke

00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:08.221
is Shamu died like 20 years ago,
right?

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.588
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.588 --> 00:03:11.691
Don't eat other sushi.

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.964
And finally Dunkin' Donuts is
now offering its holiday menu

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:20.433
which includes a pancake
Wake-Up Wrap

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.267
that's filled with eggs,
American cheese,

00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:23.636
and sausage or bacon.

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.072
The part they don't tell you is
where you'll wake up.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:29.342
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:30.577
We got a great show
for you tonight.

